This is the Executable Form of the MPL-2.0 Covered Software. The Source Code
Form is available at the Source location above. The file is test-only: it is
injected into pages by tests/browser/test_browser_ui.py, which refuses to use
it unless its SHA-256 matches the value above. It is never shipped in the
gpo-lens wheel.

To upgrade: download the new npm tarball, check its integrity against the
registry, copy package/axe.min.js and LICENSE here, update this file and the
AXE_VERSION / AXE_SHA256 constants, then regenerate the baseline with
GPO_LENS_AXE_WRITE_BASELINE=1 and review the diff.
